msgctxt "quest/015/SubCts999_01578:TEXT_SUBCTS999_01578_SYSTEM_100_727:1"
msgid "Those on platinum and gold plans may begin registering each <reset-time 18 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> from <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> and each <reset-time 19 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> from <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>, respectively. Those on the standard plan may do so each <reset-time 20 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> from <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>"
