msgctxt "quest/015/SubCts999_01578:TEXT_SUBCTS999_01578_SYSTEM_100_822:1"
msgid "You cannot reschedule a ceremony between <reset-time 18 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> and <reset-time 21 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>. This restriction will be lifted after two weeks have elapsed."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 現在、予約受付時間になっていません。<br>あなたのプランの受付開始時間は、<br>（地球時間）<switch $n1><case>無効値<case><reset-time 20 5><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時<case><reset-time 19 5><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時<case>無効値</switch>です。
#. de: Die Reservierung kann noch nicht vorgenommen werden. Mit deinem Zeremonienplan ist eine Reservierung ab<switch $n1><case> UNGÜLTIG<case> <reset-time 20 5><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if> Uhr<case> <reset-time 19 5><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if> Uhr<case> UNGÜLTIG</switch> (Erdenzeit) möglich.
#. fr: Votre formule vous permet de réserver à partir de <switch $n1><case>{0}<case><reset-time 20 5><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h<case><reset-time 19 5><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h<case>{0}</switch> (heure locale, temps réel).
#. speaker: SYSTEM
